Cohort lifetime-value views

Usage: vendo measurement ltv [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list      List cohort LTV rows
  cohort    Show one cohort by period — retention matrix + cumulative LTV curve + prediction
  customer  Show one customer's cohort + realised LTV + revenue timeline

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
